 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Sport",
     "texto": [
      "**Тренироваться** means to train; **плавать** and **бегать** can describe usual activities. **Играть в футбол** means to play football. The verb form changes with the person: **Я плаваю** (I swim), **сестра бегает** (my sister runs)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Health and obligation",
     "texto": [
      "**Следить за + instrumental** means to watch over or take care of: **Я слежу за здоровьем** (I take care of my health). After **за**, **здоровье** takes the instrumental form **здоровьем**. **Должен + infinitive** expresses obligation or necessity and agrees with the subject: **он должен**, **она должна**, **сердце должно**, **они должны**.",
      "**Два раза в неделю** means «two times a week»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
